		"Patch: Patch, Manual, Shift"
	],
	"notice": "Set MIDI channel, parameter transmit/receive options and clock source in the global settings. Enable MPE only with a compatible controller and matching channel configuration. This desktop module has no built-in keyboard.  Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected instruments appear under the interface port name. Physical controls are unbound; this profile does not provide a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected controls at illustrative positions; consult the manufacturer references for the full panel.",
